  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unity University Girls Education Project,2007-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Unity University Girls Education Project,2007-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unity University has a scholarship program for girls, intended to     give educational opportunities to around 10 000 academically capable  young women from low-income families. When Sida supported part of     this programme is completed in 2011, 35 women will receive higher     education in unity university and graduate with Degrees/ Diplomas in  the field of their interest.</narrative>
